    "answer": {
      "short": "Length $24\\text{ cm}$; width $12\\text{ cm}$.",
      "worked": "Let $w$ be the width in centimetres. The length is $2w$ centimetres.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P&=2l+2w\\\\72&=2(2w)+2w\\\\72&=6w\\\\w&=12\\\\l&=2(12)\\\\l&=24\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe length is $24\\text{ cm}$ and the width is $12\\text{ cm}$.",
